 신청하기 이전보다 더 안좋아진상황인데...</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2cc73fcc-5aa5-40e3-b556-957440ed8c94\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8e8b11d2-7d1d-488e-9063-8124086bb05e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ec7062cf-520b-4f66-8d2e-cf7efb69e38a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3d66943f-bcea-4400-92cd-090efbb9ef29\">자녀둘을 혼자키우는 상태라 생활적으로 저 금액으로 대출금 갚으면서 살아가기 힘든 상황에 빠졌습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-833a16a8-878c-4d8a-bf5d-c51ba01e8a1c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a629a3a9-5107-4d7b-8002-6cfe581ab349\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f1542e27-778f-4b93-9c71-2892bb60ff06\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6bf3c6c6-5617-467c-8f97-b60f0c32493d\">새출발기금 신청전에 연체는 없이 진행 가능하다고 하셔서 진행했어요...참고로 전 한부모랑</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-180ed184-9910-4ed1-88b9-4d6e30b43b5a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-cbc77eb5-baee-4b84-9176-f62139d3fbe5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-53a03cf2-680e-45c3-a614-5c09215cc229\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d75151b7-9845-4788-b572-ecd8b29333a9\">취약계층으로 되어 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b88d753e-5a01-4deb-9b31-06c6d551e8e7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-60da5822-901b-466f-96d7-3d56ba1c34fd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bc895fba-bc2a-48a0-8310-9a0e132d7fea\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8faea553-15a2-4a68-8f87-0be239401284\">그 이후</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-217617ea-1446-467b-9612-0923133e8944\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c1a42edd-95b3-4b2f-9757-54e3ea2f7833\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e1bc0a6e-20b2-4f7b-82f7-c963f7288784\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7f97b292-9f82-4d5e-8736-acdba025d394\">지금 변제금 최초 돈 못내고 있는상황에서 2회 미납예정상태입니다.(월 939,013원) 납부해야하구요..</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-be66522a-8653-4a29-a81f-1b33789f6484\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3ac79662-9530-4214-82dd-4dbccffd93dd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9c2f7361-b30a-4483-bd2d-18ab9a78ad47\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a6b4e4b5-491d-44b3-8940-31528969f6b8\">어플상에는 26.5.10 실효예정이라고 하는데...</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-af2c8e5c-1635-4c5c-b34c-72bb0f6fc89c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b2365141-41e6-4c73-9c1f-ff511aa3b31d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4b42ab1c-b90f-4aff-aeac-ba078424f5fc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-cfc9b5da-1032-4dfc-a51e-ea41a5ac6b98\">중요한거는 비엔케이캐피탈과 하나카드 두곳에대해 수정조정신청하라고 신복위문자와서 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0234db3b-7cf1-4979-b0cd-d79e9d4c6964\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e6e0166-ca16-4bab-9869-658767e71fed\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e7e2aaa2-d415-4763-b432-0a3c469aad62\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-755fa8d6-df7e-4a98-8a49-2adcbddb7f13\">처음엔 이게 머지? 하고 넘어갔어요..2월12일쯤 문자왔는데 오늘 또 같은 문자와서 먼가 이상해서</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-63fd6045-82b1-43a8-bb8b-2e9bf29531a8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e167844b-d396-47b6-84da-2a2cdf1a8362\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ac353993-cb9d-48f2-9a83-da6e793c69b9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-87faeaf7-2d34-4cc6-82c9-71e41a431e9e\">신복위전화상담해보니~ 연체이자발생으로 신청해서 다시 월변제금 올라가면서 수정해야한다네요..ㅠ.ㅠ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2ba0c9ad-cec7-4a66-a0b5-8fa2d4987f9d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d122798d-20c0-43e2-867c-d0cc2ee533e5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bea362aa-0a3a-49ac-bac9-2ddd20050083\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fb3ff20a-25e2-40b9-b5d6-292a47a5959d\">1.비엔케이 기발생 약정이자 2,054,293원 / 연체이자 56,084원</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d04da14b-956b-4739-b5a0-96a9524f0133\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64e9f47b-09da-4e59-9c3a-7ed6163d915e\">2.하나카드 기발생 약정이자 162,278원 / 연체이자 129,380원</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-717197f9-4658-408a-8e16-33ca447fc3b1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f674e5ca-896c-4176-beef-5993020892e9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a1100bb-67fb-4f91-9df4-feace3bf4f85\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6b3c64d9-1258-4483-8ff4-30491f39eb94\">이렇네요...</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f01055db-d037-404c-91bc-9f5621011521\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bd43d996-6158-40d3-aea5-61d0dac3a72e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-76d22423-1d6f-4c3d-9f8b-8221f864b493\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f31a8bc2-6959-4056-8807-57ae0e51c2e5\">그럼 이제 전 어떠케해야하나요?? 월 변제금도 못내고 있는상황에 저걸어떻게 해야할지..</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5fbebd72-3a04-4546-98fd-e1d08e4b3f39\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1179c05a-5235-4572-8c89-1490b737c084\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4e46dc67-9bad-4a17-a0cc-c4f4333ccb72\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5049d122-5583-4333-8581-06b1dd1160ea\">참고로 저 금액 수정하려면 미납분도 먼저 납부해야 수정해서 포함시킨다던데...</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bb7e10c6-8fae-46ee-9fb2-35842d80e331\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-785593d3-998b-43cd-86bd-7f8c21edc08a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2a0c5a22-a73b-4d2f-9f98-aa7ee58b2b9c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-80ad2ab7-726a-480d-875a-1c40dec3e6a7\">그러면 미납분만 180만원 넘는돈을 당장에 빌려야 하기도하고...막막하네요..</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-73d66987-4bc1-4cf3-a9e2-e9e063edafcb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-37e65861-4fc4-4f1d-ab05-07f4bc407cbb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bc3e3815-6e90-422b-93b7-b9c78b605b80\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-678e3ea9-6eb1-4c59-a778-9a6869f21638\">일단 총 부채가 1억 미만이라...이거 실효시키고 부실우려에서 부실차주로 가는게 맞을것같은데..</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3ff617d5-0d7d-46fc-b385-17da1a384042\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-dfb43212-dbc2-462e-adb9-ff9d821712fb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0e5b46a6-79e9-4c14-b894-49424fc89d82\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-caa3e4f5-acee-40a9-b575-67adb04feae9\">일단 2개월 미납인데 저기 두곳에서 저 부분에대한 금액으로 채권측에서 추심이나 문자갈수 있다는데.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-468f872c-a912-41fa-a0b2-352d9eb34f8c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-362b622b-ea1d-4ec0-b3a1-25f0a0fe3ffc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c8895cd3-0c5f-4ae4-b077-c25b41b9c75d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-74714463-e59c-499b-89c5-8d256411359c\">이런부분도 걱정되어서 제가 연체전 신속으로 신청했던거였거든요,,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-376953b6-81f1-4756-aa58-0d9d3baca00f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1e716c27-5335-487d-a61e-ecc14c376c8f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-33385e72-bf71-4ce7-86c9-ae5bf6b97c63\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7f36b2ae-24bf-4e3e-b934-515b2d36f687\">갑자기 또 생각이 많고 불안해지네요..그래서 여기 상담차 글 남겨요~~</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-ad50dc4e-6204-4822-a4ac-d12b6b9cbb1c\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
